# XTIDE Universal BIOS r638, XT+ build for ATA at 1F0h

The fixed-disk option ROM of the open AT templates: the XTIDE Universal BIOS r638 XT+ build (ide_xtp.bin) with its first controller set to 16-bit ATA at 1F0h (control block 3F0h), polled without an IRQ, and diskette A: as the boot drive; every other setting keeps its upstream default. The download is padded with zeros to its declared 8 KiB and its last byte makes the byte sum zero. It serves IBM 5170-class boards with a primary ATA channel, suggested at C8000h, on an 80186 or later. Licensed under GPL-2.0-only, as the project's binary download statement says; the package includes its corresponding source archive, the r638 Subversion trunk.

